> Sampled covariance geometry

The first and last complete offspring clouds are centered and scaled by
their root mean squared radius to expose the direction of their spread.
The plotted points are actual objective requests from the seed-42
16-offspring run on the rotated bowl.

\image(figures/cma_es_cloud.svg)
\alttext(Initial and final offspring clouds after removing translation and common scale.)
